      "writtenOn": "2026-01-21T23:53:22Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Ah... I see. That seems fine then. Maybe we should just add some comments in the ctor to make it clear that we should never be constructing it directly, and we should only ever be creating it via a helper function on `BufferBase`. It might be possible to encapsulate it somehow by making the ctor private?",
      "parentUuid": "2f02bd88_627cd405",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 661,
        "startChar": 4,
        "endLine": 661,
        "endChar": 63
