      "writtenOn": "2026-01-22T21:33:01Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "I made the constructor private so that only BufferBase can create it. Well except the default constructor, that has to be public for returning ResultOrError\u003cScopedUseBuffer\u003e since the caller has to do:\n\n```\nBufferBase::ScopedUseBuffer use;\nDAWN_TRY_ASSIGN(use, buffer-\u003eValidateCanUseOnQueueNow())\n```\n\nNot sure if there is a better way there?",
      "parentUuid": "a16b0b02_edde4927",
